DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260806T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260806T193000
SUMMARY:Member Meet Up: Boston Harbor Distillery 
LOCATION:Offsite: Rose Kennedy Greenway
DESCRIPTION:Category: Member Mixer\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: unlimit
 ed\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/195309\n\nJoin us f
 or a special Member Meet Up at The Rose Kennedy Greenway\, hosted by The '
 Quin's Membership Team. Spend the evening connecting with fellow members w
 hile enjoying two handcrafted cocktails on the 'House\, delicious light bi
 tes\, and great conversation in one of Boston's most vibrant outdoor space
 s.\n\nMembers will also have the unique opportunity to meet Boston Harbor 
 Distillery founder Rhonda Kallman\, who will lead an exclusive guided tast
 ing of the distillery's acclaimed Lawley's collection. Discover the fresh 
 botanical notes of their signature gins\, the rich character of their New 
 England–style rums\, and the crisp\, smooth finish of their Harborside V
 odka while learning about the inspiration and craftsmanship behind each sp
 irit.\n\nWhether you are a longtime whiskey and spirits enthusiast or simp
 ly looking for a fun evening with fellow members\, this is the perfect opp
 ortunity to sip\, socialize\, and experience one of Boston's premier local
  distilleries. \n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members 
 only. Light bites will be available on the 'House.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/195309
CATEGORIES:Member Mixer
END:VEVENT
