 htfully curated midday menu in The Terrace as you connect with fellow memb
 ers through engaging discussion prompts\, moderated by our Membership Team
 \, exploring memorable school experiences\, influential mentors\, lifelong
  learning\, and the moments that have shaped who we are today.\n\nWhether 
 you're reminiscing about favorite teachers\, reflecting on lessons learned
  beyond the classroom\, or embracing the opportunities that come with a ne
 w season\, this Serendipity gathering offers a welcoming opportunity to co
 nnect through shared stories and meaningful conversation.\n\n*Tickets are 
 $80 per person\, plus tax\, and are reserved for members only. Cancellatio
 ns within 72 hours of the event\, or failure to attend\, will be charged i
 n full. Please inform us of any dietary needs or restrictions by emailing 
